    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but is there anything else that could be \"sabotaging\" the airflow? like something smaller or more subtle that wouldn't necessarily show up on a standard mechanical inspection? i just want to be sure we aren't missing some weird little thing hiding in the vents or something.",
